Fixing the logic to handle continuous cyclic processing and trigger updates on rising edges should resolve the test failures across all scenarios. The key is ensuring that once cyclicExecution activates, subsequent cycles continue adding values until the window fills, and the trigger flag properly captures state changes for non-cyclic mode.

